Vendored Wayland protocol descriptions
=====================================

The XML files below are copied unmodified from wayland-protocols 1.50
(/usr/share/wayland-protocols on the development machine).  Each file carries
its own copyright and licence header; they are distributed under the same
terms as wayland-protocols (MIT for xdg-shell and viewporter, MIT or
Apache-2.0 for the unstable and staging protocols, see the header of each
file).

They are vendored so that a Wayland build needs no wayland-protocols package
at build time, only wayland-scanner.  The build generates the client glue from
them into the build directory; see docs/wayland-plan.md, decision 7.

  stable/xdg-shell/xdg-shell.xml
  stable/viewporter/viewporter.xml
  unstable/xdg-decoration/xdg-decoration-unstable-v1.xml
  unstable/primary-selection/primary-selection-unstable-v1.xml
  unstable/text-input/text-input-unstable-v3.xml
  unstable/xdg-output/xdg-output-unstable-v1.xml
  staging/fractional-scale/fractional-scale-v1.xml
  staging/cursor-shape/cursor-shape-v1.xml
  staging/xdg-activation/xdg-activation-v1.xml
  staging/xdg-toplevel-icon/xdg-toplevel-icon-v1.xml

Do not edit these files; update them from a newer wayland-protocols release
instead.
